source: tests/help_snapshots.rs
---
Print version information

Usage: snouty version [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                 Print help
      --json                 Output JSON where supported (NDJSON for list/stream
                             commands, pretty JSON otherwise)
      --verbose              Log API requests to stderr (authentication tokens
                             redacted)
      --settings <SETTINGS>  Path to the snouty settings file (default:
                             ./.snouty.toml; overrides SNOUTY_SETTINGS_PATH)
      --profile <PROFILE>    Settings profile to select (overrides
                             ANTITHESIS_PROFILE)
